        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Hagar Flat Push/Crash Bar, HAG-127S</b>\r\n<p>\r\nHagar flat push/crash bars are suitable for all framed glass storefront doors (aluminum, hollow metal or wood) where there is no projection on the door face.  Made of solid brass, bronze, aluminum or stainless steel, it is durable enough for the most demanding applications. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThese 1.25\" wide push/crash bars are made to your specifications in any length up to 36\".  </p>\r\n<p><b>Features and Specifications:  </b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material:  Solid Brass, Stainless Steel, Bronze or Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Bar Size:  3/8\" x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base:  1-1/4\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Projection:  3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners:  1/4 x 20 FHMS</li>\r\n<li>Meets ANSI A156.6 for J501 Push Bar</li>\r\n</ul></p>",
